000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TCLASCHK.
000400 AUTHOR.               AM TREUDLER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         NOV 11, 1987.
000600*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000800*REMARKS.
